# Shell scripts run on Linux, including from a Windows checkout through WSL:
# a CR at a line end becomes part of the last word.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The same for Gradle's wrapper in the Android project, run from the WSL copy
# and on CI's Linux runner.
gradlew text eol=lf
# Cargo writes these with LF whatever the checkout has, which left a change
# git showed with identical bytes after every build.
src-tauri/Cargo.toml text eol=lf
src-tauri/Cargo.lock text eol=lf
# The packages' desktop entry template: read on Linux by the bundler, and
# by a test that looks for its lines on every system.
src-tauri/linux/*.desktop text eol=lf
